<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores at the close of play on</p>
<p>the second day of the Supersport Series cricket matches played</p>
<p>on Saturday.</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province 433-3 declared (Herschelle</p>
<p>Gibbs 163 not out, Jacques Kallis 138, Desmond Haynes 83), Natal</p>
<p>249-5 (Derek Crookes 63 not out, Neil Johnson 52).</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Free State 178 and 183-3 (Gerhardus</p>
<p>Liebenberg 83 not out), Eastern Province 198 (Louis Koen 57,</p>
<p>Kepler Wessels 57)</p>
<p>In Centurion: Transvaal 115-5 (Adam Bacher 59 not out)</p>
<p>against Northern Transvaal.</p>
</text>
